# Unfixable OS-level CVEs in python:3.11-slim (Debian 13.4)
# No upstream fix available as of 2026-04-30.
# Tracked: review monthly and remove when Debian releases a patch.

# ncurses buffer overflow — affects libncursesw6, libtinfo6, ncurses-base, ncurses-bin
CVE-2025-69720

